{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a <strong>flexible strategy</strong> card game infused with <strong>Rogue-lite</strong> elements, where every adventure brims with unpredictability. Confronting randomized dungeons, unexpected events, and a multiverse setting, each choice you make will forge a completely unique gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build Your Deck , Explore Endless Dungeons!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411020/extras/en1.png?t=1751002931\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The '1+4' minimalist deck-building system : 1 core card + 4 support cards</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Five elements : Water, Fire, Wood, Light, Dark \u2013 craft unpredictable builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diverse rune customization : unique abilities to elevate your combat experience<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411020/extras/battle1.gif?t=1751002931\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411020/extras/battle2.gif?t=1751002931\" /></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411020/extras/en2.png?t=1751002931\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 300 cards to strategize with,every battle presents a new deck-building challenge!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flexibly adapt your battle deck then immerse in strategic thrills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In-run deck crafting &amp; evolution: Even unwanted cards forge your path to power.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411020/extras/cards.gif?t=1751002931\" /></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411020/extras/en3.png?t=1751002931\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diverse dungeon modules: Every expedition ventures into the unknown.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fresh treasures &amp; formidable foes await your discovery.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411020/extras/map.gif?t=1751002931\" /></div>\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411020/extras/en4.png?t=1751002931\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Randomized encounters await in your adventure,shape your destiny with every decision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recover, upgrade, or warp unpredictably,prove your mastery of strategy &amp; serendipity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411020/extras/events.gif?t=1751002931\" /></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411020/extras/en5.png?t=1751002931\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Salvage loots from failed runs,the meta progressions improve your power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beyond a single dungeon.An intricate multiverse where infinite possibilities converge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411020/extras/multi_villages.png?t=1751002931\" /></div></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3411020?t=1751002931","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3411020?t=1751002931","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411020/0a5bf93b75399b47f9be9cffdfd5dff389278de6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751002931","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411020/0a5bf93b75399b47f9be9cffdfd5dff389278de6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751002931","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a <strong>flexible strategy</strong> card game infused with <strong>Rogue-lite</strong> elements, where every adventure brims with unpredictability. Confronting randomized dungeons, unexpected events, and a multiverse setting, each choice you make will forge a completely unique gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build Your Deck , Explore Endless Dungeons!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411020/extras/en1.png?t=1751002931\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The '1+4' minimalist deck-building system : 1 core card + 4 support cards</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"b